## Configuration

Add the {{displayName}} provider to your `simplens.config.yaml`:

```yaml
providers:
- name: {{name}}
package: '@simplens/plugin-{{name}}'
credentials:
{{#each credentials}}
{{this}}: ${{screamingSnakeCase this}}
{{/each}}
{{#unless credentials.length}}
# Add your credentials here
{{/unless}}
options:
rateLimit:
maxTokens: 100
refillRate: 10
```

## Usage

### Sending Notifications

```typescript
import { SimpleNS } from '@simplens/core';

const simplens = new SimpleNS();

await simplens.send({
channel: '{{channel}}',
recipient: {
{{#each recipientFields}}
{{this}}: 'your-{{this}}-value',
{{/each}}
{{#unless recipientFields.length}}
// Add recipient fields
{{/unless}}
},
content: {
{{#each contentFields}}
{{this}}: 'your-{{this}}-value',
{{/each}}
{{#unless contentFields.length}}
// Add content fields
{{/unless}}
},
});
```

